# 📡️ P2-FG1: `IfcSnapshot::encode_pack_with` wraps a `SemioEnvelope` header (`wrap_binary`, envelope
# id `stdio.ifc`, component `Pack`, version 1) around the UTF-8 bytes of
# `write_part21(&to_part21_document(self))` — the SAME Part-21 text the DSL facet emits. No packed
# binary layout of its own exists at this facet; text-native, same shape as the sibling STEP
# artifact's own snapshot protocol (both reuse the shared Part-21 tokenizer). The SEMIO envelope is
# described ONCE, framework-side — this file describes ONLY the post-unwrap payload.
dialect protocol
protocol stdio.ifc.snapshot
version 1
schema stdio.ifc
start body

framing record
chain payload utf8
